<title>USA: Fed's Minehan says Fed must be vigilant on prices.</title>
<headline>Fed's Minehan says Fed must be vigilant on prices.</headline>
<dateline>CHATHAM, Mass. 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Federal Reserve Bank of Boston President Cathy Minehan said the Federal Reserve should continue to be vigilant in its fight against inflation.</p>
<p>&quot;I beleive the Federal Reserve should continue to be vigilant and proactive in insuring the fires of inflation are not reignited,&quot; Minehan said.</p>
<p>The Boston Fed chief was speaking at the start of a conference on social security sponsored by the Boston Fed.</p>
